 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "1995-11-02",
   "text": "Colorectal Cancer Screening Act of 1995 - Amends title XVIII (Medicare) of the Social Security Act to prescribe frequency and payment limits under Medicare part B (Supplementary Medical Insurance) for screening fecal-occult blood tests, flexible sigmoidoscopies, barium enemas, and other appropriate screening procedures for colorectal cancer, such as a colonoscopy."
  }
